(exclude ($MatchRequired $Conn4) "The concept case, and the cases that take UnmatchedStays and FirstWins. Another case with MatchRequired or ClashUndefined is subsumed: wherever it is defined, the case with UnmatchedStays and FirstWins in their place gives the same grid.")
(exclude ($MatchRequired $RoleBySize) "The concept case, and the cases that take UnmatchedStays and FirstWins. Another case with MatchRequired or ClashUndefined is subsumed: wherever it is defined, the case with UnmatchedStays and FirstWins in their place gives the same grid.")
(exclude ($MatchRequired $FirstWins) "The concept case, and the cases that take UnmatchedStays and FirstWins. Another case with MatchRequired or ClashUndefined is subsumed: wherever it is defined, the case with UnmatchedStays and FirstWins in their place gives the same grid.")
(exclude ($MatchRequired $FillOnly) "The concept case, and the cases that take UnmatchedStays and FirstWins. Another case with MatchRequired or ClashUndefined is subsumed: wherever it is defined, the case with UnmatchedStays and FirstWins in their place gives the same grid.")
(exclude ($MatchRequired $AnchorBySharedColor) "The concept case, and the cases that take UnmatchedStays and FirstWins. Another case with MatchRequired or ClashUndefined is subsumed: wherever it is defined, the case with UnmatchedStays and FirstWins in their place gives the same grid.")
(exclude ($ClashUndefined $Conn4) "The concept case, and the cases that take UnmatchedStays and FirstWins. Another case with MatchRequired or ClashUndefined is subsumed: wherever it is defined, the case with UnmatchedStays and FirstWins in their place gives the same grid.")
(exclude ($ClashUndefined $RoleBySize) "The concept case, and the cases that take UnmatchedStays and FirstWins. Another case with MatchRequired or ClashUndefined is subsumed: wherever it is defined, the case with UnmatchedStays and FirstWins in their place gives the same grid.")
(exclude ($ClashUndefined $UnmatchedStays) "The concept case, and the cases that take UnmatchedStays and FirstWins. Another case with MatchRequired or ClashUndefined is subsumed: wherever it is defined, the case with UnmatchedStays and FirstWins in their place gives the same grid.")
